# Phase 0 two-lives smoke test (no player needed). Expect: both dimensions answer, gamerules true,
# and the corridor floor exists at 0 64 0. The death flow itself is tested in game: die in the
# Mortal Realm → Corridor with offers → /ttl choose <race> → Tensura overworld.
execute in ttl:mortal_realm run time query gametime
execute in ttl:spirit_corridor run time query gametime
gamerule noUniqueStart
gamerule trulyUnique
execute in ttl:spirit_corridor if block 0 64 0 minecraft:sea_lantern
# The hall is the blueprint structure: its first (north) Last Wish pedestal.
execute in ttl:spirit_corridor if block 0 65 -11 minecraft:polished_deepslate
